          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "任务：逐字段比较身份，标出缺失，并列出可继续的行政整理与必须暂缓的身份或临床相关步骤。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "medical-assistants.path.career-path-block.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-medical-guidance"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "参考答案：姓名一致；出生日期不一致；脉搏缺失。可整理不依赖身份确认的空白表格，但身份相关步骤暂缓，出生日期交有权限人员复核；不猜补脉搏或作诊断。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "medical-assistants.path.career-path-block.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-medical-guidance"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
